msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Benford's law states that the distribution of leading digits in a population "
"naturally follows a certain distribution. In auditing, assessing whether a "
"distribution of digits in the population conforms to Benford's law may "
"provide additional evidence that the transactions in the population might "
"need further investigation. Non-conformity to Benford's law does not "
"necessarily indicate fraud. A Benford's law analysis should therefore only "
"be used to acquire insight into whether a population might need further "
"investigation."
msgstr ""
"本福德定律係指母體中首位數字的分布自然而然地遵循某種特定分布。在審計中，評估"
"母體中之數字分布是否符合本福德定律，可能提供額外證據，顯示母體中之交易可能需"
"要進一步調查。不符合本福德定律並不一定表示舞弊。因此，本福德定律分析僅應用於"
"取得洞見，以了解母體是否可能需要進一步調查。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"In this box the variable is selected whose digits should be tested against "
"the reference distribution. The value zero (0) will be omitted from the data."
msgstr ""
"在此方塊中選取要針對參考分布檢定其位數的變數。數值零 (0) 將自資料中省略。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid "Choose the distribution to test against."
msgstr "選擇要檢定的參考分布。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid "Test the specified digits against Benford's law."
msgstr "針對本福德定律檢定所指定的位數。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid "Test the specified digits against the uniform distribution."
msgstr "針對均勻分布檢定所指定的位數。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid "Specify which digits to extract from the data and test."
msgstr "指定要從資料中擷取並檢定的位數。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Extract and test the first digit of the items against the specified "
"reference distribution."
msgstr "擷取項目的首位數字，並針對所指定的參考分布進行檢定。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Extract and test the first and second digit of the items against the "
"specified reference distribution."
msgstr "擷取項目的首位及第二位數字，並針對所指定的參考分布進行檢定。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Extract and test the last digit of the items against the specified reference "
"distribution."
msgstr "擷取項目的末位數字，並針對所指定的參考分布進行檢定。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid "Choose which type of Bayes factor to display."
msgstr "選擇要顯示的貝氏因子類型。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Bayes factor to quantify evidence for the alternative hypothesis relative to "
"the null hypothesis."
msgstr "用於量化對立假設相對於虛無假設之證據的貝氏因子。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Bayes factor to quantify evidence for the null hypothesis relative to the "
"alternative hypothesis."
msgstr "用於量化虛無假設相對於對立假設之證據的貝氏因子。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid "Natural logarithm of BF10."
msgstr "BF10 之自然對數。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Specify options that have an effect on the look and feel of the audit report."
msgstr "指定會影響審計報表之外觀與風格的選項。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"When checked, enables explanatory text in the analysis to help interpret the "
"procedure and the statistical results."
msgstr "勾選後，會在分析中啟用說明文字，以協助解讀程序與統計結果。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"The confidence level used. The confidence level is the complement of the "
"audit risk: the risk that the user is willing to take to give an incorrect "
"judgment about the population. For example, if you want to use an audit risk "
"of 5%, this equals 95% confidence."
msgstr ""
"所使用的信賴水準。信賴水準是審計風險之補數：使用者願意承擔對母體作出錯誤判斷"
"的風險。例如，若您想使用 5% 的審計風險，這相當於 95% 的信賴水準。"

