msgctxt "SamplingUnits|"
msgid "Items"
msgstr "項目"

msgctxt "SamplingUnits|"
msgid ""
"Performs selection using the items (rows) in the population as sampling "
"units."
msgstr "使用母體中之項目（列）作為抽樣單位來執行選取。"

msgctxt "SamplingUnits|"
