msgstr "按一下以進一步了解此方法"

msgctxt "SelectionMethod|"
msgid "Cell sampling"
msgstr "格子抽樣"

msgctxt "SelectionMethod|"
msgid ""
"Performs selection by dividing the population in equal intervals and "
"selecting a variable unit in each interval. Any item with a value larger "
"than twice the interval will always be included in the sample."
msgstr ""
"透過將母體分成相等間隔並在每個間隔中選取變動單位來執行選取。數值大於間隔兩倍"
"之任何項目一律納入樣本。"

msgctxt "SelectionMethod|"
msgid "Random sampling"
msgstr "隨機抽樣"

msgctxt "SelectionMethod|"
msgid ""
"Performs random selection in which each sampling unit has an equal chance of "
"being selected."
msgstr "執行每個抽樣單位具有相等被選取機會之隨機選取。"

msgctxt "SelectionMethod|"
msgid "Modified sieve sampling"
msgstr "修正式篩選抽樣"

msgctxt "SelectionMethod|"
msgid "Performs modified sieve sampling."
msgstr "執行修正式篩選抽樣。"

msgctxt "SelectionOutput|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "SelectionOutput|"
